{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2022-11-17 11:00:00', 'title': 'MULESOFT RECOGNIZED AS A LEADER IN GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT™ FOR FULL LIFE CYCLE API MANAGEMENT', 'text': 'FOR THE SEVENTH TIME IN A ROW, MULESOFT WAS RECOGNIZED AS A LEADER BASED ON COMPLETENESS OF VISION AND ABILITY TO EXECUTE SAN FRANCISCO , NOV. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SALESFORCE [NYSE: CRM], THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GARTNER® HAS RECOGNIZED MULESOFT AS A LEADER IN THE 2022 GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT FOR FULL LIFE CYCLE API MANAGEMENT . THIS IS THE SEVENTH TIME IN A ROW THAT MULESOFT HAS EARNED THIS RECOGNITION.'}